      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holcomb%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Holcomb Historical Society, founded in 1984, preserves the town’s past in a museum housed in the 1901 schoolhouse on the National Register.",
